<title>UK: Newman Tonks gets possible offer from FKI.</title>
<headline>Newman Tonks gets possible offer from FKI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building supplier Newman Tonks Group Plc said on Monday that it has received an approach from engineering company FKI Plc which might lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
